1
00:01:22,519 --> 00:01:23,159
Boss Su,

2
00:01:23,359 --> 00:01:24,439
we haven't met for a few days.

3
00:01:24,959 --> 00:01:26,159
Shouldn't you settle

4
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:27,879
the agreed-upon wages?

5
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:33,159
You want wages for an unfinished job?

6
00:01:33,359 --> 00:01:37,319
No, I don't.

7
00:01:39,239 --> 00:01:39,879
It hurts.

8
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:43,280
I don't have any cash on me.

9
00:01:43,359 --> 00:01:43,959
In a couple of days...

10
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,840
I can wait a few days.

11
00:01:47,519 --> 00:01:49,200
But the money for Dabao's candy...

12
00:01:54,079 --> 00:01:55,400
You said

13
00:01:55,799 --> 00:01:56,680
you could hire someone.

14
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,400
Do you want the money?

15
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:01,000
Let go of me.

16
00:02:05,079 --> 00:02:05,879
Wait here.

17
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,719
You have a bright future.

18
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:14,919
Do you know the rules of the agency?

19
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,080
No.

20
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,840
Thirty taels of silver

21
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:20,759
and you'll be hired immediately.

22
00:02:30,599 --> 00:02:31,159
That's enough.

23
00:02:31,719 --> 00:02:36,000
Remember to come to work tomorrow.

24
00:02:36,599 --> 00:02:36,879
Wait.

25
00:02:36,879 --> 00:02:39,000
What's wrong with you?

26
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:40,560
How dare you lie to me?

27
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:43,000
I'll take your hand.

28
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,919
Su's Escort Agency

29
00:02:46,039 --> 00:02:47,439
never lies to anyone.

30
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:50,039
We're family from now on.

31
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,599
How can I lie to you?

32
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,120
Don't worry.

33
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:55,599
Go.

34
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:56,879
Come to work tomorrow.

35
00:03:16,599 --> 00:03:17,159
Mr. Su,

36
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,919
remember to call me next time.

37
00:03:20,039 --> 00:03:20,360
Come here.

38
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:23,680
If you dare to pinch me again,

39
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,000
I'll make you have no candy to eat.

40
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:26,840
Go, go, go.

41
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,240
Goodbye, Mr. Su.

42
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:35,000
The brain is a good thing,

43
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:38,680
but you don't have it.

44
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,680
So when do we move?

45
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,680
If you don't move, you'll live here.

46
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:57,879
Mr. Su, just let me go.

47
00:03:58,280 --> 00:04:00,080
Even if I can get up at 3 a.m. every day,

48
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,120
I can't do anything

49
00:04:01,159 --> 00:04:02,560
with this noise in the morning.

50
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,840
If your brother comes to fix the broken board again,

51
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:05,960
I'm afraid the Xingyun Conference...

52
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:07,520
I've found you a room in Huayue Tower.

53
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,759
You can go there at 5 a.m. every day

54
00:04:10,039 --> 00:04:10,800
to read and sleep.

55
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:11,319
as you wish.

56
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:15,800
So living in the agency is to shut people up.

57
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:18,439
In Huayue Tower, you can prepare for the Starry Night Gala.

58
00:04:19,439 --> 00:04:20,240
Great.

59
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:22,879
Then,

60
00:04:23,439 --> 00:04:25,519
you'll pay the rent, right?

61
00:04:26,519 --> 00:04:27,319
I will.

62
00:04:28,399 --> 00:04:29,399
You're so thoughtful.

63
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,240
Cheng Qi, thank you.

64
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:50,839
New bedding.

65
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,360
There are beds available,

66
00:04:52,399 --> 00:04:53,480
Why do you have to make yourself suffer?

67
00:04:53,879 --> 00:04:54,800
Don't catch a cold and get sick.

68
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,600
Otherwise, everyone will suffer with you.

69
00:04:57,879 --> 00:04:58,879
Thank you, my lady.

70
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,279
The furnishings in this room

71
00:05:33,279 --> 00:05:35,639
were all specially arranged by Ms. Tang.

72
00:05:36,519 --> 00:05:38,920
You are truly blessed.

73
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,360
I'm afraid you've got it wrong.

74
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,879
My wife is just understanding.

75
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,199
Ms. Tang

76
00:05:46,519 --> 00:05:47,600
is a person of righteousness.

77
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,040
Thank you.

78
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,560
Mr. Su is really good to you.

79
00:05:54,199 --> 00:05:55,120
She left you breakfast in the morning,

80
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,519
and gave you an extra quilt at night.

81
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,639
She also arranged such a nice room for you.

82
00:06:00,399 --> 00:06:01,079
I

83
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:02,480
wanted to test her,

84
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:04,720
but she really agreed.

85
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,000
Miss Su

86
00:06:08,759 --> 00:06:10,839
is really a tough but tender person.

87
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:17,279
My Lord,

88
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,680
it's good to stay

89
00:06:20,319 --> 00:06:21,079
in the Escort Agency.

90
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,160
Yeah, it's good.

91
00:06:25,279 --> 00:06:27,879
But we've been through a lot.

92
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,079
Don't forget

93
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:30,879
what we're here for.

94
00:06:35,439 --> 00:06:36,000
Cheng Qi,

95
00:06:37,199 --> 00:06:38,079
you must

96
00:06:39,399 --> 00:06:41,560
win the championship in the Starry Sky Conference.

97
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:48,199
My Lord,

98
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,680
I want to go out.

99
00:06:50,399 --> 00:06:51,480
To the Moon God Pavilion?

100
00:06:51,879 --> 00:06:52,839
Be quick.

101
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,800
Are you two playing?

102
00:07:08,399 --> 00:07:09,040
Focus.

103
00:07:14,519 --> 00:07:15,639
I've told you,

104
00:07:15,879 --> 00:07:17,680
your money only gets you in.

105
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:18,800
You can't choose who to work for.

106
00:07:19,319 --> 00:07:20,279
If she doesn't want you,

107
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,680
no refund.

108
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:23,639
Let's go.

109
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,439
Jiaojiao,

110
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,279
this new escort

111
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,600
will be with you from now on.

112
00:07:39,839 --> 00:07:40,800
New escort?

113
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,120
I don't want him.

114
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,360
You can keep him.

115
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,480
Good intentions taken for granted.

116
00:07:46,199 --> 00:07:47,519
He's a really good prospect.

117
00:07:48,079 --> 00:07:49,879
If he's not good enough, he can follow me.

118
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:54,879
Name?

119
00:07:54,959 --> 00:07:55,480
Age?

120
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,399
Where are you from?

121
00:07:56,639 --> 00:07:57,160
What are you good at?

122
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,079
Bai Yanliang.

123
00:07:59,360 --> 00:07:59,839
21.

124
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:01,000
I live in the east of the capital.

125
00:08:01,199 --> 00:08:01,800
I'm good at using a broadsword.

126
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,160
The east?

127
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:05,000
I live in Ning'an.

128
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:09,279
I'm frank

129
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,120
and simple-minded.

130
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:11,600
Gong Xi.

131
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,480
- My Lord. - It hurts.

132
00:08:45,279 --> 00:08:45,679
Please.

133
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,320
You were holding back.

134
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,360
Go get the escort uniform.

135
00:09:15,639 --> 00:09:16,080
My Lord,

136
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,159
no new design,

137
00:09:18,679 --> 00:09:19,360
but I found an old one.

138
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:31,720
Make do with it for now.

139
00:09:31,879 --> 00:09:33,120
Later, I'll have Gong Xi

140
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,960
to make you a new one.

141
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:37,080
No need.

142
00:09:38,919 --> 00:09:39,559
This is fine.

143
00:09:50,639 --> 00:09:51,320
Su Yuejiao,

144
00:09:51,879 --> 00:09:52,759
my life

145
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,000
is yours from now on.

146
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,799
Just a escort,

147
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,360
not a lifelong contract.

148
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,519
Just protect the goods.

149
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:03,559
Well,

150
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:05,360
I'll call you Bai from now on.

151
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:07,200
You're the same as Gong Xifacaicheng.

152
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:07,919
Call me boss.

153
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:16,799
Oh, no.

154
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,159
I knew she would run away.

155
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,879
I always open the door at 9 a.m.

156
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:21,919
Remember next time.

157
00:10:23,039 --> 00:10:24,080
I thought about it all night.

158
00:10:24,559 --> 00:10:26,320
Even if you're not with Miss Yan,

159
00:10:26,679 --> 00:10:28,360
the Moon God Pavilion is still a scam.

160
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:30,799
How much do you make

161
00:10:31,039 --> 00:10:31,799
following your master?

162
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:32,720
No money.

163
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:33,559
I and my master

164
00:10:33,559 --> 00:10:34,200
have no money.

165
00:10:34,879 --> 00:10:36,320
How dare you say this is a black shop?

166
00:10:38,759 --> 00:10:40,080
If you work for me in the future,

167
00:10:40,279 --> 00:10:41,039
I'll give you one taels of silver

168
00:10:41,159 --> 00:10:42,279
for an hour.

169
00:10:42,559 --> 00:10:43,000
How about it?

170
00:10:45,039 --> 00:10:45,559
Boss,

171
00:10:45,759 --> 00:10:46,840
what do you need me to do?

172
00:10:55,679 --> 00:10:57,240
What did Meng Feifei do to you?

173
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:00,960
My Lord,

174
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,799
will you be here all day from now on?

175
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:03,480
What?

176
00:11:03,799 --> 00:11:04,799
Are you going to work here tomorrow?

177
00:11:05,679 --> 00:11:06,200
Yes.

178
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:12,799
Young man,

179
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,120
don't play with fire.

180
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:17,720
You may be tired out.

181
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:30,120
Won't he be tired working like this?

182
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:31,799
He just came here for the first time,

183
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,039
and he's recommended by my uncle.

184
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,200
There must be something wrong.

185
00:11:35,679 --> 00:11:36,960
What's wrong with working?

186
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,159
He works so hard,

187
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,840
which makes us look lazy.

188
00:11:40,039 --> 00:11:42,200
Then he can replace us and escort with My Lord.

189
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,919
Split from inside.

190
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,320
Uncle replaces My Lord.

191
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,720
Kill two birds with one stone.

192
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,559
We must not let him succeed.

193
00:12:02,559 --> 00:12:03,360
I'm back.

194
00:12:06,279 --> 00:12:06,960
Let me tell you.

195
00:12:07,279 --> 00:12:08,879
thanks for your help.

196
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:11,000
I've been working hard these days,

197
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:11,919
and I've got a lot of ideas.

198
00:12:12,399 --> 00:12:13,159
That's great.

199
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:15,279
Or you'd blame me for your writer's block.

200
00:12:15,679 --> 00:12:17,399
You're so smart-mouthed.

201
00:12:17,679 --> 00:12:18,240
No, I'm not.

202
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:20,559
I'll pay back the rent

203
00:12:20,559 --> 00:12:21,440
after the Star Conference.

204
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,799
It's already deducted from your salary.

205
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:25,480
You... you're exploiting me.

206
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:36,320
I...

207
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,600
Don't you dare touch her!

208
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:38,759
I'm her husband.

209
00:12:38,759 --> 00:12:39,639
Who are you?

210
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,759
What did you say?

211
00:12:46,879 --> 00:12:49,120
I said I'm Su Yuejiao's husband.

212
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,039
My dear, my honey.

213
00:12:50,039 --> 00:12:50,960
With your face?

214
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:51,919
I don't approve!

215
00:13:02,039 --> 00:13:03,080
Bro,

216
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:05,600
it doesn't matter if you approve or not.

217
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,039
Is he good at fighting?

218
00:13:07,879 --> 00:13:09,039
I fell in love with her at first sight.

219
00:13:09,039 --> 00:13:09,679
We love each other.

220
00:13:09,679 --> 00:13:10,480
We are predestined.

221
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:11,360
We are soulmates.

222
00:13:37,519 --> 00:13:38,360
Never mind.

223
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,360
Who are you?

224
00:13:39,399 --> 00:13:39,759
I'm

225
00:13:41,799 --> 00:13:42,639
the new escort.

226
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:44,080
The new escort?

227
00:13:45,879 --> 00:13:47,679
If you are the new escort,

228
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:49,639
you should learn from Gong Xi and Facha

229
00:13:49,639 --> 00:13:50,360
how to escort.

230
00:13:51,519 --> 00:13:51,919
My lady,

231
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:52,879
let's go.

232
00:13:59,679 --> 00:14:00,200
Bro,

233
00:14:00,519 --> 00:14:01,399
you don't have to work so hard.

234
00:14:01,759 --> 00:14:02,879
If you are so willing to work,

235
00:14:03,240 --> 00:14:04,960
I'll leave the hitching to you tomorrow.

236
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:06,080
I'm also a servant.

237
00:14:23,639 --> 00:14:24,039
My Lord,

238
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:25,080
we robbed the escort

239
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:26,120
we robbed the escort

240
00:14:26,399 --> 00:14:27,200
of the Fuyun Escort Agency.

241
00:14:27,559 --> 00:14:28,200
Good job.

242
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:31,840
How's the investigation going?

243
00:14:32,279 --> 00:14:34,320
After we robbed Su, he went to Ning'an County.

244
00:14:34,799 --> 00:14:36,559
He got married a few days after he came back.

245
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:40,440
Wait for my message.

246
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:42,639
Ask all the brothers to come here.

247
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:44,480
The food here

248
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:45,639
is good.

249
00:14:47,279 --> 00:14:47,799
I see.

250
00:14:48,159 --> 00:14:48,519
My Lord

251
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,039
You are an undercover

252
00:14:50,679 --> 00:14:51,960
and want to infiltrate the enemy.

253
00:14:53,039 --> 00:14:53,919
Brilliant!

254
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:09,120
If you want to eat freshly fried dough sticks tomorrow,

255
00:15:09,279 --> 00:15:10,840
go out early and eat them yourself.

256
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,080
I have to escort in the morning.

257
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:12,960
I don't have time to buy for you.

258
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:15,039
Okay, my wife.

259
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:17,480
There's no one else here.

260
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:19,080
Who are you acting for?

261
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:24,960
Here.

262
00:15:28,519 --> 00:15:29,679
Love each other.

263
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:34,679
My dear wife.

264
00:15:36,879 --> 00:15:38,840
Bao and the Seven Fairies.

265
00:15:40,519 --> 00:15:41,480
Did you write all these?

266
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:42,960
No.

267
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:44,720
Then why do you give them to me?

268
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:45,679
I don't like reading.

269
00:15:47,039 --> 00:15:48,320
The point is not reading.

270
00:15:50,039 --> 00:15:52,159
We agreed to pretend to be a couple.

271
00:15:52,759 --> 00:15:53,919
We should look like a real couple.

272
00:15:54,679 --> 00:15:55,960
We can't be obviously fake.

273
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:56,799
Right?

274
00:16:03,159 --> 00:16:03,679
And

275
00:16:04,159 --> 00:16:05,200
Bai Yanli

276
00:16:05,399 --> 00:16:07,120
is targeting me from the beginning.

277
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:08,679
I seriously suspect that

278
00:16:08,679 --> 00:16:10,799
your uncle is testing us.

279
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:13,320
He can't do that.

280
00:16:14,559 --> 00:16:16,159
You are not sensible enough.

281
00:16:16,679 --> 00:16:18,879
You should learn from these books

282
00:16:18,879 --> 00:16:19,919
from these books.

283
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:22,799
I think you are right.

284
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,639
But I can fight,

285
00:16:25,159 --> 00:16:26,120
but I get sleepy

286
00:16:26,639 --> 00:16:27,720
when I read.

287
00:16:28,639 --> 00:16:30,360
I've thought about it.

288
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:36,639
These books

289
00:16:37,039 --> 00:16:38,200
are full of pictures.

290
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:39,559
You'll understand at a glance.

291
00:16:39,679 --> 00:16:40,559
